diagnostic_evidence.quote:
Given parameters $p \ge 1$ and $\tau > 0$, we define the smooth shut-off function
\begin{equation}
  s_j = h(\eta_j) = \frac{\eta_j^p}{\eta_j^p + \tau^p}.
\end{equation}

failure_location.quote:
[S_j V]_{j-1} = [S_j V]_j
  = \frac{h\,V_{j-1} + \alpha h\, V_j}{h + \alpha h}
  = (1-\alpha)V_{j-1} + \alpha V_j.

